@page rh="THE HOUSE OF VANE · THE DOCUMENTS" m="TKC: TL · FR 40–44; VOL. I · {v1:ledger} · {v1:texts}"
# The documents, in order
tabrl:
| When | What happens to the paper | Source |
| 2061 | The ledger names Elias. Dorian, a child, learns it, and it's the only thing he's ever been certain of. | FR 44 |
| 2062–85 | Crest preserves the documents, the one thing he did. Neither destroyed nor used, left where the east wing archive would someday be inventoried. | FR 40 |
| 2085–98 | Unmoved for thirteen years, because nobody was looking | FR 41 |
| 2098 | Azrael, twenty-one, finds the ledger legitimately during a Crown advisory access period, and brings it to his father | TL, FR 41 |
| 2098 | Dorian tells him to put it back. A document Azrael has read and returned is one Dorian controls, and destroying it would have told Azrael it mattered. | TL, FR 43 |
| 2098–2100 | Azrael looks for the Covenant of Dissent, written in the same hand the same year. He doesn't find it. What he finds is enough. | TL |
| 2100 | The week Azrael is declared dead, the ledger and the Dissent both vanish. Dorian took them. | TL, FR 42 |
small: CONFLICT: The timeline says Azrael doesn't put the ledger back, and also that it vanishes from the east wing archive in 2100 (TL). INFERENCE: Somewhere between the two he returned it, or Dorian took it from somewhere else.
prompt: Where Dorian keeps them now | fill

@page rh="THE HOUSE OF VANE · WHO KNOWS AZRAEL IS ALIVE" m="TKC: TL · TR; OPEN QUESTION"
# Four people
Azrael has been in Mountain Dominion under another name for four years, in a community whose patriarch owes the Vane family a debt that predates the Trials Commission by a decade. Four people know he's alive: Judah, Lyris, and two others (TL).
tabrl:
| Who | How they know | What it costs them |
| Judah | _ | _ |
| Lyris | _ | _ |
| _ | _ | _ |
| _ | _ | _ |
rec:
OPEN QUESTION · Dorian | Does he know? He removed the documents the week Azrael was declared dead (FR 42), and the files don't say who arranged the "medical event."
POSSIBLE · the patriarch | One of the two others, since the debt is to the family (TL).
POSSIBLE · Hannah | Judah "has always known" about her (TL).
OPEN QUESTION · Petra | The boy next door disappeared into Mountain terrain four years ago, the same year (TR). Who is he to Azrael?
